### Media attachments (D128) ###
# Development default for app.media.storage-root. Uploaded bytes are not source, and in any
# real deployment this root lives outside the repo and the war entirely.
/media-storage/

### Claude Code ###
# The rest of .claude/ is shared team config and stays tracked. This one file is not: it names a
# sibling checkout by relative path and pins a port, so it is true only on one machine.
.claude/launch.json

# Scratch prompt handed to a review agent, kept out of history. Safe to delete.
/brief-mvp-plan-review.txt
